  "prefLabel": "Bea 507.03 Eligibility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 507.03 Eligibility. A municipality shall have an active HC designation in order to apply for and be awarded a HIM grant. A municipality shall only receive one award in a given state fiscal year, unless sufficient program funding exists to fund all other eligible applications first within an application funding round.\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
